NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover the source code in src/ and the documentation.

They do NOT cover the images in reports/. Those are derived from MIDV-500, which
is distributed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.5 Generic
(CC BY-SA 2.5). Share-alike propagates to derivative works, so those images
remain under CC BY-SA 2.5 and must keep their attribution:

  Arlazarov, V.V., Bulatov, K., Chernov, T., Arlazarov, V.L.
  "MIDV-500: A Dataset for Identity Documents Analysis and Recognition on
  Mobile Devices in Video Stream." Computer Optics 43(5), 2019.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.05786
  Dataset: ftp://smartengines.com/midv-500/

No dataset images are redistributed in bulk; reports/ contains only small
derived figures used to illustrate results.

Whether trained model weights (models/*.pt) constitute a derivative work of the
training data is unsettled and not asserted either way here.
